{
  "title": "ARGUS Overview",
  "uid": "argus-overview",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "argus"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Requests / sec",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(argus_http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "In-flight requests",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "argus_http_in_flight",
          "legendFormat": "in-flight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Cache hit ratio",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(argus_cache_operations_total{result=\"hit\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(argus_cache_operations_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "hit ratio"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Rate-limit rejections / sec",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(argus_rate_limit_rejections_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "429/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Request rate by endpoint",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (path) (rate(argus_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "HTTP latency p50 / p95 (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(argus_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(argus_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Role outcomes / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (role, status) (rate(argus_role_outcomes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Tokens / min by role",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (role) (rate(argus_role_tokens_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} {{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Role latency p95 (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, role) (rate(argus_role_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Router decisions / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (method, matched_profile) (rate(argus_router_decisions_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{matched_profile}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Transcriptions / sec by outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(argus_transcriptions_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Transcription latency p95 (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(argus_transcription_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Report jobs / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(argus_report_jobs_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Investigation time trio p50/p90 (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_first_evidence_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "first-evidence p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_first_evidence_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "first-evidence p90"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_useful_answer_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "useful-answer p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_useful_answer_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "useful-answer p90"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_final_report_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "final-report p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(argus_time_to_final_report_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "final-report p90"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Loop-stop reasons / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 54
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(argus_loop_stops_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Tool calls / sec by tool/outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 54
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (tool, status) (rate(argus_tool_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Tool latency p50/p90 by tool (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 62
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, tool) (rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le, tool) (rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} p90"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Investigation cost p50/p90 (USD)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 62
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(argus_investigation_cost_usd_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(argus_investigation_cost_usd_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p90"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(argus_investigation_cost_usd_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cost events/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Web-call (proxy) outcomes / sec",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 70
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service, status) (rate(argus_proxy_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Tokens / min by role/type",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 70
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (role, type) (rate(argus_role_tokens_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} {{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Answer feedback ratings / min",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 78
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (rating) (rate(argus_feedback_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "rating={{rating}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Investigation feedback ratings / min",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 78
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (rating) (rate(argus_investigation_feedback_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "rating={{rating}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "title": "Serial-vs-parallel: method (text)",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 86
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "Serial-vs-parallel method (recorded metrics only):\n\nSerial sum = sum(rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_count[5m])) x calls, i.e. total tool-time per second if every call ran serially.\n\nParallel span is NOT directly recorded (no per-investigation span metric exists). Approximate it with the investigation time trio (panel 14: first-evidence / useful-answer / final-report p50/p90), which measures observed wall-clock progress while tools overlap.\n\nParallelism saving ~= serial tool-time per investigation window minus observed wall-clock trio value. See panel 24 for the serial tool-time rate; compare against panel 14. No new metrics invented.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "title": "Serial tool-time per sec (sum of latencies)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 86
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "argus-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_sum[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "serial tool-time s/s"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (rate(argus_tool_latency_seconds_sum[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "serial {{tool}} s/s"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
